Text Notes 800 10500 0 75 ~ 0
Set SW1=MUTE before power changes; wait >=2 s, set volume to minimum, then PLAY. Measure Tip/Ring DC before use.
Text Notes 800 10800 0 75 ~ 0
Split mono before the amplifiers. Never join AMP_L and AMP_R. Sleeve is actual ground, not a virtual ground.
